      "text": "The B \u2192A loss is defined symmetrically, and the final objective is LMCVPCL = LA\u2192B + LB\u2192A.\nHere sg(\u00b7) denotes stop-gradient and \u03c4 is temperature, (n) and (m) index windows in the minibatch.\n",
