      "text": "As shown in Figure 3, with additional details in Figure 7, we freeze G\u03b8 and train a product-\nquantized VAE tokenizer on the latent obtained from masked wearable observations zmask =\nG\u03b8(Mask(X, M)) \u2208RT \u2032\u00d7d. A projection maps each timestep latent zmask\n",
      "bbox": [
